    dcterms:source "https://github.com/ocsf/ocsf-schema (git tag 1.9.0)" ;
    dcterms:title "Open Cybersecurity Schema Framework (OCSF) categories and event classes"@en,
        "Catégories et classes d'événements de l'Open Cybersecurity Schema Framework (OCSF)"@fr ;
    owl:versionIRI <https://w3id.org/crgo/vocab/0.10.0/ocsf> ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.9.0" ;
    skos:hasTopConcept ocsf:1,
        ocsf:2,
        ocsf:3,
        ocsf:4,
        ocsf:5,
        ocsf:6,
        ocsf:7,
        ocsf:8 ;
    skos:scopeNote "Event categories and event classes of OCSF 1.9.0 (no attributes or profiles). Notation: category uid, or class uid = category uid x 1000 + class uid. Linking a normalisation profile or rule to a class states a correspondence, not an equivalence of taxonomies."@en .

